  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral Project to Support the Strengthening of the Resilience of Vulnerable Refugee, Returnee, and Host Populations in Wadi Fira Province (PMARRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the resilience of vulnerable refugee, returnee, and host populations in Wadi Fira, Chad, through an integrated, multisectoral approach. Activities focus on protection (including GBV and child protection), health, nutrition, WASH, food security, and livelihoods, ensuring inclusive access to basic services and supporting socio-economic opportunities while promoting social cohesion and dignity</narrative>
  </description>
